<title>INDIA: India's Motor Ind H1 1996 net down.</title>
<headline>India's Motor Ind H1 1996 net down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	  136.6  vs    150.8</p>
<p>    Sales	     5,202.8  vs  4,363.5</p>
<p>    Other income	 75.7  vs     45.2</p>
<p>    Expenditure     4,304.3  vs  3,590.9</p>
<p>    Interest costs     52.2  vs     40.1</p>
<p>    Depreciation	540.0  vs    402.5</p>
<p>    Tax		   260.0  vs    280.0</p>
<p>Note: The Bangalore-based Motor Industries Company Ltd (MICO) is a leading manufacturer of automotive components.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
